#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Huna ruhusa kwa kifaa cha klasta hiyo."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Jina: klasta nyingine tayari inatumia jina hili."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Klasta haikuhifadhiwa: ilibadilishwa na mtu mwingine tangu fomu ifunguliwe, au uandishi ulishindwa. Ifungue tena na urudie mabadiliko."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Klasta imehifadhiwa."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Hali ya klasta haikubadilishwa: uandishi ulishindwa. Tazama kumbukumbu ya Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Klasta na picha yake iliyohifadhiwa kwenye akiba zilifutwa. Kifaa chake na grafu zilihifadhiwa. Kipanga ratiba hakikuwasilianwa nacho."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Kifaa na grafu zake vimeundwa."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Kifaa hakikuundwa: klasta tayari ina kifaa, kilibadilishwa na mtu mwingine tangu ukurasa ufunguliwe, au Cacti ilikikataa. Tazama kumbukumbu ya Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Klasta imeunganishwa na kifaa."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Klasta haikuunganishwa: kifaa hakipo, hakiruhusiwi kwako, tayari kina klasta nyingine, au klasta ilibadilishwa na mtu mwingine tangu ukurasa ufunguliwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Grafu zilizokosekana zimeongezwa."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Hakuna grafu zilizoongezwa: klasta haina kifaa, au kifaa chake hakipo tena."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Klasta haikutenganishwa: ilibadilishwa na mtu mwingine tangu ukurasa ufunguliwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Klasta imetenganishwa. Kifaa na grafu zake vimehifadhiwa."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Sehemu zimeorodheshwa upya kutoka kwenye picha ya hali."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Sehemu hazikuorodheshwa upya: kifaa kimezimwa au hakipatikani, kwa hivyo Cacti iliruka hoja yake ya data."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Sehemu hazikuorodheshwa upya: Cacti haikuweza kuendesha hoja ya data. Tazama kumbukumbu ya Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Sehemu hazikuorodheshwa upya: hoja ya data ya HPC Scheduler haijasakinishwa. Sakinisha violezo kutoka ukurasa wa afya."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Sehemu hazikuorodheshwa upya: klasta haina kifaa, au kifaa chake hakipo tena."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Violezo vya HPC Scheduler vimesakinishwa."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Violezo havikusakinishwa: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Mwonekano wa ufuatiliaji"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Maangalizo hayakuweza kusomwa. Mwombe msimamizi aangalie kumbukumbu ya programu-jalizi."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Kagua familia za sababu zinazosubiri na upya wa picha ya hali kwenye muhtasari. Pandisha masuala ya vitambulisho, uunganishaji wa klasta na sera ya matengenezo kwa msimamizi."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Jina: tumia herufi 1 hadi 64, tarakimu, nukta, mistari ya kuunga, au mistari chini, ukianza na herufi au tarakimu."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: chagua mojawapo ya poller zilizoorodheshwa."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Muda wa Ukusanyaji: weka sekunde kamili kuanzia %d hadi %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Usafirishaji: chagua moja ya njia za usafirishaji zilizoorodheshwa."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: weka njia kamili, au iache tupu ili kutumia chaguo-msingi la mkusanyaji."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "URL ya slurmrestd: seva hii na lango hili haviko kwenye orodha ya seva za slurmrestd katika Mipangilio."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "URL ya slurmrestd: weka URL ya https:// bila jina la mtumiaji, hoja, au kipande; http:// ya kawaida inakubaliwa tu kwa anwani ya loopback."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Mtumiaji wa slurmrestd: tumia herufi zisizozidi 64, tarakimu, nukta, mistari ya kuunga, au mistari chini, au iache tupu kwa tokeni ya mtumiaji."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Faili ya Tokeni: weka njia kamili ya faili ya tokeni kwenye mkusanyaji. Tokeni yenyewe haiingizwi hapa kamwe."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Faili ya Tokeni: hakuna saraka za faili za tokeni zilizowekwa bado. Mwombe msimamizi wa Cacti aziweke chini ya Mipangilio, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Faili ya Tokeni: faili lazima iwe ndani ya mojawapo ya saraka za faili za tokeni zilizowekwa katika Mipangilio (%s)."

