#: lib/ClustersPage.php
msgid "Client commands use the binaries set under Settings > HPC Scheduler and the poller user's own Slurm authentication; the optional slurm.conf path selects a cluster. slurmrestd fields are used only with that transport. The token file must be readable by the poller user only; the plugin reads it at each run and never stores the token."
msgstr "Amri za mteja hutumia programu za binary zilizowekwa chini ya Mipangilio > HPC Scheduler na uthibitishaji wa Slurm wa mtumiaji wa mkusanyaji mwenyewe; njia ya slurm.conf ya hiari huchagua klasta. Sehemu za slurmrestd hutumika tu na usafirishaji huo. Faili ya tokeni lazima isomeke na mtumiaji wa mkusanyaji pekee; programu-jalizi huisoma kwa kila uendeshaji na haihifadhi tokeni kamwe."

