#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Data Parser"
msgstr "Kichanganuzi cha Data"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Kichanganuzi cha data cha Slurm kwa amri za mteja. Chagua kile ambacho toleo la kila klasta inayosomwa kupitia amri za mteja linakuja nacho: v0.0.43 imo katika 25.05, 25.11, na 26.05 na imeondolewa katika 27.05; v0.0.44 inahitaji 25.11 au mpya zaidi; v0.0.45 inahitaji 26.05 au mpya zaidi. Ukurasa wa afya huonya wakati klasta inaporipoti toleo lisilo nacho. Klasta zinazosomwa kupitia slurmrestd hupuuza mpangilio huu: zinatumia kichanganuzi kipya zaidi kati ya hivi kinachotolewa na huduma ya daemon, na ukurasa wa afya huonyesha ni kipi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya kuelekea squeue kwenye kila kikusanyaji kinachosoma klasta kupitia amri za mteja. Programu-jalizi huiendesha tu kama squeue --all --json pamoja na kichanganuzi cha data kilicho hapo juu."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya kuelekea scontrol. Programu-jalizi huendesha tu scontrol --json show node, show partition, na show reservation; kamwe si update, reconfigure, au token."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya kuelekea sshare, inayotumika tu kwa klasta zinazokusanya mgawo wa haki."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Vikomo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Mwisho wa Wito"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Sekunde ambazo wito mmoja wa kipanga ratiba unaweza kuchukua kabla haujasimamishwa na sehemu yake kurekodiwa kuwa imeshindwa. Wito pia hauwezi kuendelea kupita bajeti ya muda wa kisomaji."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa Juu wa Jibu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "MiB ambazo wito mmoja wa kipanga ratiba unaweza kurejesha. Jibu kubwa zaidi hutupwa na sehemu yake kurekodiwa kuwa imeshindwa. Usimbuaji unahitaji takriban mara 12 ya ukubwa wa jibu, kwa hivyo kisomaji hutumia kiwango kisichozidi (Kumbukumbu ya Ukusanyaji - 64) / 12 MiB na ukurasa wa afya huonya thamani hii inapokuwa kubwa zaidi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "Kumbukumbu ya Ukusanyaji"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "MiB za kumbukumbu ya PHP ambazo kila uendeshaji wa ukusanyaji huinua kikomo chake hadi hapo (haipunguzi kamwe). Chaguo-msingi la 1024 linatosha majibu hadi 80 MiB."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya kuelekea prlimit (util-linux), inayotumika kuweka kikomo cha nafasi ya anwani ya kila amri ya mteja. Acha wazi ili kuendesha amri bila kikomo cha kumbukumbu; kisha ukurasa wa afya utaonya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Kumbukumbu ya Amri"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "MiB za nafasi ya anwani ambazo kila amri ya mteja inaweza kutumia, kupitia prlimit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "Vitambulisho vya slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Saraka za Faili za Tokeni"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Saraka kamili kwenye vikusanyaji zinazoweza kuhifadhi faili za tokeni za slurmrestd, zikitenganishwa kwa koma au nafasi. Klasta inaweza kutaja faili ya tokeni iliyo ndani ya mojawapo ya hizo tu, inayomilikiwa na mtumiaji wa kikusanyaji na kufikiwa bila kiungo cha ishara. Weka kila saraka iweze kuandikwa na root na mtumiaji wa kikusanyaji pekee. Ikiwa tupu inamaanisha hakuna klasta inayoweza kutumia slurmrestd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "Seva Pangishi za slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Si lazima. Seva pangishi za slurmrestd ambazo klasta inaweza kutaja, kama host au host:port, zikitenganishwa kwa koma au nafasi. Ingizo lisilo na mlango linaruhusu mlango wowote kwenye seva pangishi hiyo. Ikiwa tupu inaruhusu seva pangishi yoyote."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Sekunde kabla ya muda wa tokeni kuisha ambapo ukurasa wa afya huanza kuonya, ikiwa tokeni ina muda wa kuisha."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Onyo la Kuisha Muda wa Tokeni"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Sakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Weka Majedwali ya Programu-jalizi Wakati wa Kusakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Ikiteuliwa, kuondoa programu-jalizi kutahifadhi klasta zake na picha za hali. Ondoa uteuzi ili uondoaji uzifute; hamisha klasta kwanza kutoka HPC Clusters. Programu-jalizi haiundi vifaa vya Cacti au ratiba za Maint katika toleo hili, na hakuna mawasiliano yanayofanywa na kipanga ratiba kwa vyovyote vile."

