#: lib/TokenState.php
msgid "refused: outside the token file directories set in Settings, reached through a symbolic link, not a regular file, writable by others, or too large; the log names the reason"
msgstr "imekataliwa: iko nje ya saraka za faili za tokeni zilizowekwa katika Mipangilio, imefikiwa kupitia kiungo cha ishara, si faili ya kawaida, inaweza kuandikwa na wengine, au ni kubwa mno; kumbukumbu inataja sababu"

